WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:02.370
He's mine.

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:03.600
No, he's mine.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.670
Mine!

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:05.400
Mine!

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.000
Mine!

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.530
Mine!

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:08.530
Enough already!

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:09.900
Let him go, Dantalion!

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:09.900
Silence!

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:11.740
Kevin!

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:08.690
Cheer up, William.

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:13.160
I'm fine, thank you very much.

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:18.150
I must say, it's not like you to 
be so concerned with someone else.

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:23.120
I couldn't care less about people 
who are of no use to me.

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:27.910
But Kevin's not just anyone...

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:33.410
H-He manages all of my family's affairs.

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:35.540
I don't need things to be awkward between us.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:37.920
Say, William...

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:41.000
Why don't you ask him to 
come by on family day?

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:42.470
Family day?

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:45.110
That'll give you two a chance to talk.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.980
<i>Twice a year, the dormitories 
have a "family day"</i>

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:53.220
<i>when family members come 
to the school to visit.</i>

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:57.450
<i>Though, with my Uncle Barton having vanished,</i>

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.950
<i>I don't expect anyone will come asking for me.</i>

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.200
Hey, Twining!

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:04.690
I need to skip out today.

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:07.970
You're a prefect! Don't be so open about it!

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:09.800
Yeah, sorry.

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:12.210
It's just... my dad's coming.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.670
Isn't that a good thing?

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:15.430
Well...

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:19.630
He's been pressuring me to 
transfer into military school,

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:21.300
so I'd rather not see him.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.520
Colonel Swallow wants you to join the army?

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:25.830
Yeah.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:31.360
He's been pushing me to enlist ever 
since he nearly died in that fall.

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.190
<i>Oh, yeah...</i>

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:35.640
<i>I saw that in the paper.</i>

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:37.930
<i>They said it was a miracle he survived.</i>

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:41.290
So, I'll be giving him the runaround today.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.740
I expect he'll come to you, 
since you're a prefect.

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:47.910
You owe me one.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.110
Thanks, Twining!

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:56.420
Everyone was so happy with our tea!

00:03:56.890 --> 00:04:00.170
<i>It's not as if I suddenly miss 
having parents right now, but...</i>

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:01.940
My grades? Well...

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:05.470
<i>Young Master!</i>

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.100
<i>It's tea time.</i>

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:14.920
<i>Already?</i>

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:15.810
<i>Yes!</i>

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:19.510
<i>I know. Why don't we race 
back to the mansion?</i>

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:21.240
<i>What? Why should I?!</i>

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:25.110
<i>Okay, I'll cast my bet that I will win!</i>

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:28.160
<i>You're not listening.</i>

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:32.310
<i>Come along, Young Master.</i>

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:58.780
Excuse me, is William Twining here?

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:01.230
That would be me, sir.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.310
You're him?

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.390
Oh, forgive me.

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:11.690
Pleased to meet you. I'm Adrian Swallow.

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:12.950
Likewise.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:17.850
I apologize for intruding, 
but have you seen my son?

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:18.730
No, sir.

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:20.130
I see.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:22.690
I'm sorry I can't help...

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:27.250
By the way, have you 
recovered from your fall?

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:29.180
Yes.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:35.000
And is your family here today?

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:36.440
No, sir.

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:37.940
Ah, forgive me.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:43.460
I've heard quite a bit about you from my son.

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:46.070
Would you care to join me for dinner tonight?

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:48.780
S-Sure?

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:51.780
<i>Why am I having dinner with Swallow's dad?!</i>

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.410
William Twining.

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:57.580
Kevin!

00:05:57.880 --> 00:06:00.920
Er, um... Pastor Cecil.

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:02.820
May I have a word?

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:05.030
Please?

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:06.420
Who are you?

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:09.550
The campus pastor, Kevin Cecil.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:17.410
I suppose I'll head home for today, then.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:18.920
Perhaps another time.

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:22.740
If you see my son, tell him 
he'd better uphold his promise.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.420
What the heck was all that?

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:29.030
Kevi—

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.010
He ditched you, eh?

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:39.460
Shut up!

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:44.420
He ditched you, eh?

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:49.340
So, were you behind this?

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:52.300
No, it was probably the fly.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.810
Ah, Beelzebub, then.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:59.440
Leave it to him to do things 
in such a roundabout way.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:06.000
Remember the demon law.
You mustn't interfere

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.590
in the affairs of others.

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:15.270
Things are going to get problematic.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:20.250
I need you to watch over Solomon in my stead.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:24.360
Stay close to him and protect 
him from evil, Raguel.

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:26.280
Understood.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:41.310
Ugh...

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:44.560
Too many people break curfew on family day...

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:49.070
Hey, it's past lights out!

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:50.320
Hey.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.530
Swallow?

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.530
Sorry, were you asleep?

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:55.750
Not yet.

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:58.790
I wanted to ask you a favor.

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:02.800
Are you free on our next day off?

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:04.380
I don't have anything planned...

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.110
Great!

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:08.320
Will you come the Cotswolds with me?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:09.540
Huh?

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.590
Come home with me, Twining.

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:16.760
I want you to meet my parents.

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:21.710
Whoa! What are you getting at?!

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.060
Oh, sorry...

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:27.510
We're celebrating my father's recovery,

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:29.670
and he said he'd like you to attend.

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:32.860
<i>Celebrate his recovery?</i>

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:35.010
<i>No, wait a second.</i>

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:37.590
<i>A party to celebrate Colonel 
Swallow's recovery</i>

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:40.370
<i>should be packed with all 
manner of upper crust.</i>

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.680
<i>It'll be an elite dinner party.</i>

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:47.500
Sorry, I guess it was a little out of the blue...

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:50.500
I'd be delighted, Swallow!

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:53.350
Great! I'm sure my dad will be thrilled!

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.970
This is his doing, too.

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:57.930
This is getting serious...

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:02.930
Astaroth, you are as breathtaking as ever.

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.390
Marry me again.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:06.520
Die!

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.700
Annoying fly.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:14.260
You must think you have some time 
to kill if you're playing around here.

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:16.690
Dropping out of contention 
for the Emperor's throne?

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:18.490
Perish the thought.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:23.370
I'm already making my move on Solomon.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:24.750
Oh?

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:33.510
Why are you two coming?!

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:36.790
Why else? I'm sick of school food.

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:37.970
Same here.

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:39.900
You two...

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:41.760
I don't mind.

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:51.520
Welcome, good to see you again.

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:54.280
I'm honored that you invited me, sir.

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:57.450
Please, enjoy yourself.

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:05.290
Say, isn't that Mr. Winterhalter over there?

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:07.500
<i>Winterhalter?</i>

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:10.770
<i>As in the queen's favorite painter?!</i>

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:15.880
<i>He's a famous playwright, and he's 
a professor at the royal academy!</i>

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:17.970
<i>And he's a cabinet minister!</i>

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.930
<i>Wow!</i>

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.010
Thanks for coming.

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:27.630
S-Sure... Boy, this is incredible.

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:29.560
It's nothing but society's elite.

00:10:29.890 --> 00:10:31.800
They're all just showing off.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:33.650
You're probably disappointed.

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.500
No way, not one bit!

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.950
<i>The famous army colonel lives up to his title.</i>

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:42.520
<i>I need to get close to him and 
make some major connections...</i>

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:45.660
<i>Viva politics!</i>

00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:49.080
Twining, you're exuding some kind of black aura...

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:04.810
Have you resolved that problem you were having?

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.190
Yes.

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:34.330
You need a Frenchman or an Italian 
if you want a real chef.

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:37.780
Last time was just awful.

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:41.090
Did they serve meat that came from the freezer?

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:56.640
<i>What was that?</i>

00:11:57.470 --> 00:11:58.940
<i>Just my imagination?</i>

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:06.700
My dad changed after his accident...

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:11.960
He was never proactively in 
favor of going off to war...

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:16.520
But now he's so distant...

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:25.450
Would you come with me?

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:28.800
I'd like to introduce you to Sir David.

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:29.750
Sure.

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.660
Excuse me, Twining.

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:32.460
Right.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:38.350
Would you care for a drink?

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:41.440
Kevin?!

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:45.890
S-Sorry, I mistook you for someone else.

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:47.770
You seem tired.

00:12:47.770 --> 00:12:49.630
Would you care to lie down?

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:51.080
Y-Yes.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:53.160
Follow me.

00:12:57.890 --> 00:12:59.830
If you'll excuse me.

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:00.640
Thanks.

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:19.000
<i>I wonder...</i>

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:23.320
<i>Did Kevin actually want to 
be a priest to begin with?</i>

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:30.330
<i>Maybe he didn't want to 
be our house steward...</i>

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:56.730
So, where are we with the matter at hand?

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:58.980
Oh no, I dozed off...

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:02.870
Our main opposition in parliament 
is already under our thumb.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:05.990
The rest of parliament will follow soon enough.

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:10.550
A scandal or two, and they'll be easy pickings.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:14.310
<i>Is this some kind of secret 
meeting of the political elite?</i>

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:15.950
<i>I knew they were the string-pullers!</i>

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:19.330
Then it's off to war.

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:22.030
<i>War?</i>

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:24.550
<i>They intend to start a war?</i>

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:28.260
All we need now is Solomon's soul.

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:33.820
We need to move before the 
exorcists can get in our way.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:36.370
He's already in our sights.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:40.150
Our master is sure to be pleased 
with our report tonight.

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:47.240
William Twining, you are 
Solomon, and Hell's Elector.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.710
Baron Swallow... you couldn't be...

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:17.930
I never expected you to show up,

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:19.450
Eligos.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:22.300
Dantalion...

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:24.860
Who permitted you to 
interfere in my business?

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:27.600
I'm not interfering.

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:30.520
I'm simply protecting my master.

00:15:33.710 --> 00:15:35.770
That's another one of your acquaintances?!

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:37.570
How cruel, Master.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.260
You've forgotten me, haven't you?

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:43.380
Then let me remind you.

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:45.850
My name is Eligos.

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:47.840
Leader of sixty legions of Hell.

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:51.760
Your 15th pillar, the 
"Marquess of the Battlefield,"

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:55.580
and most importantly, now a 
servant of Prince Beelzebub.

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:59.090
For him, my true love, I will obliterate you,

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:00.230
Elector!

00:16:03.950 --> 00:16:05.050
Twining?

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:07.600
Sytry's here, too?

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:10.820
Dad?

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:14.610
That's not your father. It's a demon.

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:17.410
What? That's crazy talk.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:19.780
Your father's dead.

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:24.080
He died in that accident.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:29.840
That demon is only using his corpse 
to make it appear like he's alive.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:39.520
No...

00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:41.350
He can't be...

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:42.920
You leave me no choice.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:46.150
I'll just take this one's 
soul and call it a night!

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:56.780
Swallow!

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:57.950
No, William!

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.830
She's got Beelzebub on her side.

00:17:02.530 --> 00:17:05.640
Demon law prohibits us from interfering 
with one another's affairs.

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:10.670
There's nothing we can do!

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:19.790
Like I care about that! Let me go!

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:21.020
Swallow!

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:25.160
I'll save him.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:27.690
Don't be ridiculous!

00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:32.110
I'll deal with the fallout 
from Beelzebub afterwards.

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:36.070
Elect me, William.

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.240
Choose me to rule Hell.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:40.930
You sneak!

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:48.920
Lamb of God,

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:51.210
you take away the sins of the world.

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:55.340
Have mercy on us.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:03.430
Heartless angel, you will submit to me

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:08.440
or you will be vanquished with holy water!

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:23.070
Dad!

00:18:23.070 --> 00:18:24.290
Stop, Swallow!

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:26.910
The dead

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:28.980
can't come back.

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:45.020
Adrian Swallow's body is no more.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:47.020
The butler?

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:52.840
Your father was being used by that demon.

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:03.000
Amen.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:13.170
<b>[Measure fails by only 5 votes]</b>

00:19:13.930 --> 00:19:16.140
<i>Looks like we avoided a war.</i>

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:17.490
Twining.

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:20.190
Got a minute?

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:23.430
Swallow? You're okay to come back?

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:28.840
It's been hell dealing with 
his estate, so I ran away.

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:29.770
I see.

00:19:30.300 --> 00:19:34.190
I'm sure I've got a mountain 
of schoolwork waiting for me.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.690
You'll catch up in no time.

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:54.970
<i>It's about time I cleared the air, too.</i>

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:00.010
Young Master?

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:04.170
Kevin.

00:20:04.780 --> 00:20:05.650
Listen...

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:06.720
Yes?

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:12.230
If... If you want to quit 
being my house steward

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:13.810
and be a priest instead,

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:16.270
I understand...

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:22.830
Oh no, you're firing me?!

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:25.120
Aren't you the one who wants to quit?!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:27.330
This is just a job!

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:30.090
Then why are you avoiding me?

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:31.290
Tell me!

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.920
Is it because I'm penniless now?

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:37.280
You said I could pay you back 
when I'm a huge success!

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:39.170
Young Master, I—

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:46.960
These... These are...

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:47.640
Football Betting Pool

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:49.990
Well, you see...

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:52.000
At these public schools,

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:56.560
the staff always bet on the 
intermural sports games...

00:20:57.300 --> 00:21:00.270
So you were avoiding me because...

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:03.320
You know you're not much of 
an athlete, Young Master...

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:06.200
I was afraid I'd want to 
bet on you out of guilt...

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.660
How dare you say that to your master?!

00:21:11.610 --> 00:21:12.860
Divine punishment!

00:21:12.860 --> 00:21:15.060
Ouch!

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:30.880
And then?

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:34.650
It appears Beelzebub was indeed involved.

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:37.890
The mentor of the third candidate

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:40.740
for interim ruler, correct?

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:42.820
Holy Uriel...

00:21:44.380 --> 00:21:48.390
You should not be in a place like this.

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:52.290
I will do anything you ask of me...

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:54.440
So please!

00:21:56.130 --> 00:21:58.330
I thank you, Raguel.

00:21:58.790 --> 00:21:59.750
I would—

00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:00.630
Of course...

00:22:02.900 --> 00:22:04.050
Solomon.

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:08.440
I will not let the demons have you.

00:23:40.780 --> 00:23:44.740
I do hope my sweet little 
nephew is behaving himself,

00:23:44.740 --> 00:23:49.080
but take your eyes off him for a second,
and he's bound to cause trouble.

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:51.600
Welcome to Morton, Incorporated!

00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:55.130
Help yourself to the finest teas 
from India, China, and Sri Lanka!
